---
const stats = [
  { id: 'statYears', target: 15, label: 'Years Combined Experience' },
  { id: 'statProjects', target: 250, label: 'Pools Completed' },
  { id: 'statClients', target: 200, label: 'Happy Clients' },
  { id: 'statAwards', target: 5, label: 'Awards Won' },
];
---
<section class="intro">
  <div class="container intro-grid">
    <div class="intro-text">
      <span class="eyebrow">Based in Dubai</span>
      <h2>A pool is only as good as the details nobody sees.</h2>
      <p>The tiling under the waterline, the slope of the deck, the way the plant room is laid out — that's where most pool projects quietly go wrong. Pools by Loftmax gets those details right first, then makes it beautiful.</p>
      <p>Whether you're starting from an empty plot, replacing a tired old liner, or trying to work out why your pump won't stop tripping, we treat every job — big or small — with the same level of attention.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Get In Touch</a>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-stats">
      {stats.map((stat) => (
        <div class="stat" data-target={stat.target}>
          <strong id={stat.id}>0</strong>
          <span>{stat.label}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
